From 49303dfacf9a982d28c47502cf68efdc12275d38 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vraxa <200693817+vraxa@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:20:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Replay Plus: a camera kit for the replay editor, on top of
 Replay Shake

A panel in the replay editor (R3 + RB, or F10): a lens built from its
settings, bars and overlays, a camera curve and colour grade, keyframed
depth of field, a camera light, the game's own effects held, the editor's
picture shape and render scale, and presets saved as files that can be
named, exported and imported. Holding R3 gives shortcuts for focus and
shake keys, shown on the editor's timeline. Everything is drawn under the
game's UI and into exported videos.

On Replay Shake (Animator Studio 2.1.5, ReSkate 20261116).
